OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering overnight cloud
OL,6,Fand rain will soon clear the east.
OL,7,FOtherwise bright spells and a few
OL,8,Fshowers in the morning, becoming
OL,9,Fincreasingly dry and bright through
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,13,Fincreasing clear spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds. Staying dry and becoming chilly
OL,15,Fovernight with a rural grass frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
