OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry but chilly start with
OL,6,Fsome brightness but cloud gradually
OL,7,Fspilling east in the morning. Rain
OL,8,Fspreads east through the afternoon and
OL,9,Fevening. Becoming windy with southerly
OL,10,Fcoastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,13,Fspells and a few showers Friday and
OL,14,FSaturday, becoming frequent for a time
OL,15,FFriday night. Occasionally heavy rain
OL,16,Fspreads east on Sunday. Windy at times
OL,17,FFriday, and Saturday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
